<mxCell id="add-it5-11" value="&lt;b&gt;LayeringRulesTest (ArchUnit), run with the unit tests&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;R1 api must not depend on infrastructure&lt;br&gt;R2 model must not depend on services, api or infrastructure&lt;br&gt;R3 the new domain packages must not depend on Spring or JPA&lt;br&gt;R4 lendingmanagement must not depend on notificationmanagement&lt;br&gt;R5 notification JPA entities stay in its infrastructure&lt;br&gt;R6 no new cycles between the *management modules (frozen baseline)" style="shape=note;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;size=12;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=6;fontSize=10;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#666666;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="740" y="60" width="420" height="130" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="add-it5-12" value="&lt;b&gt;Test seams&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• policies, selector, renderer: plain unit tests, SUT = domain&lt;br&gt;• application services: fake in-memory repositories&lt;br&gt;• providers and channels: stubbed gateways, one contract test for every provider&lt;br&gt;• PIT mutation testing on model and services (threshold 75%)" style="shape=note;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;size=12;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=6;fontSize=10;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#666666;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="740" y="230" width="420" height="100" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
